msgstr "Používať tlačidlá vľavo a vpravo na otáčanie stránok"

msgid "Disable key repeat"
msgstr "Zakázať automatické opakovanie stlačeného tlačidla"

msgid ""
"Useful if you don't like the behavior or if your device has faulty switches"
msgstr ""
"Užitočné, ak sa vám nepáči automatické opakovanie stlačeného tlačidla alebo "
"ak má zariadenie chybné tlačidlá"

msgid "About fully refreshing screens"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Showing a new content on an E-ink screen usually does not fully clear the "
"previous content and leaves some blur. It may be referred as E-ink shadow or "
"ghosting.\n"
"The blur needs a full refresh to be cleared cleanly. But a full refresh can "
"be slow and trigger a flicker.\n"
"KOReader allows users deciding the frequence of the full refresh, i.e. more "
"full refreshes for better display quality or less full refreshes for "
"responsiveness.\n"
"Usually you do not to adjust this configuration, the balanced setting should "
"be good enough for most of the use cases."
msgstr ""

msgid "Never automatically fully refresh screen"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The full refresh will happen only when showing an image, moving to next "
"chapter or opening another book."
msgstr ""

msgid "Low full refresh rate for better responsiveness"
msgstr ""

msgid "Balance between responsiveness and quality"
msgstr ""

msgid "High full refresh rate for better display quality"
msgstr ""

msgid "Color rendering"
msgstr "Farebné vykreslenie"

msgid "Disable double tap"
msgstr "Zakázať dvojité ťuknutie"

msgid "DPI set to %1. This will take effect after restarting."
msgstr "DPI nastavené na %1. Nastavené bude sa po reštarte."

msgid "DPI set to auto. This will take effect after restarting."
msgstr "DPI automaticky. Nastavené bude sa po reštarte."

msgid "Set DPI"
msgstr "Nastaviť DPI"

msgid "Set custom screen DPI"
msgstr "Nastaviť vlastné DPI obrazovky"

msgid " (%1)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Screen DPI"
msgstr "DPI obrazovky"

msgid "Auto DPI (%1)"
msgstr "Automatické DPI (%1)"

msgid "Auto DPI"
msgstr "Automatické DPI"

msgid ""
"The DPI of your screen is automatically detected so items can be drawn with "
"the right amount of pixels. This will usually display at (roughly) the same "
"size on different devices, while remaining sharp. Increasing the DPI setting "
"will result in larger text and icons, while a lower DPI setting will look "
"smaller on the screen."
msgstr ""
"DPI vašej obrazovky sa rozpozná automaticky, takže text a ikony možno "
"vykresliť so správnym počtom pixelov. Tieto sa zvyčajne zobrazia v "
"(približne) rovnakej veľkosti na rôznych zariadeniach pri zachovaní pôvodnej "
"ostrosti. Zvýšenie nastavenia DPI bude mať za následok väčší text aj ikony, "
"zatiaľ čo pri nižšom nastavení DPI to bude na obrazovke vyzerať menšie."

msgid "Custom DPI: %1 (hold to set)"
msgstr "Vlastné DPI: %1 (podržaním nastaviť)"

msgid "Custom DPI"
msgstr "Vlastné DPI"

msgid "E-ink settings"
msgstr "Nastavenia E-ink displeja"

msgid "Use lower refresh rate when appropriate"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"E-ink may laggy when refreshing, avoid refreshing the screen for the "
"intermedia states, e.g. when scrolling, can be beneficial to reduce the "
"laggy or blur.\n"
"A reloading of the book may be needed to take effect."
msgstr ""

msgid "Avoid mandatory black flashes in UI"
msgstr "Zabrániť čiernemu preblikávaniu v užívateľskom rozhraní"

msgid ""
"Fully rendering a black area can be slow and increase the blur on the E-ink, "
"avoiding full refreshes of the black areas may improve the device "
"responsiveness in exchange of potentially observing partially rendered black "
"areas, especially on menus and buttons."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ignore accelerometer rotation events"
msgstr "Ignorovať udalosti rotácie akcelerometra"

msgid "This will inhibit automatic rotations triggered by your device's gyro."
msgstr "Toto zablokuje automatické otáčanie vyvolané gyroskopom zariadenia."

msgid ""
"When checked, the gyro will only be honored when switching between the two "
"inverse variants of your current rotation,\n"
"i.e., Portrait <-> Inverted Portrait OR Landscape <-> Inverted Landscape.\n"
"Switching between (Inverted) Portrait and (Inverted) Landscape will be "
"inhibited.\n"
"If you need to do so, you'll have to use the UI toggles."
msgstr ""
"Keď je začiarknuté, gyroskop bude rešpektovaný iba pri prepínaní medzi dvoma "
"inverznými variantmi vašeho aktuálneho otočenia,\n"
"t. j. Portrét <-> Obrátený portrét ALEBO Na šírku <-> Obrátené na šírku.\n"
"Prepínanie medzi (Obrátený) Portrét a (Obrátený) Na šírku bude zablokované.\n"
"Ak to potrebujete urobiť, budete musieť použiť prepínače používateľského "
"rozhrania."

msgid "Keep current rotation across views"
msgstr "Zachovať aktuálne otočenie v rámci všetkých zobrazení"

msgid ""
"When checked, the current rotation will be kept when switching between the "
"file browser and the reader, in both directions, and that no matter what the "
"document's saved rotation or the default reader or file browser rotation may "
"be.\n"
"This means that nothing will ever sneak a rotation behind your back, you "
"choose your device's rotation, and it stays that way.\n"
"When unchecked, the default rotation of the file browser and the default/"
"saved reader rotation will not affect each other (i.e., they will be "
"honored), and may very well be different."
msgstr ""
"Ak je začiarknuté, pri prepínaní medzi prehliadačom súborov a čítačkou sa "
"zachová aktuálne otočenie v oboch smeroch, a to bez ohľadu na to, aké je "
"uložené otočenie dokumentu alebo predvolené otočenie čítačky alebo "
"prehliadača súborov.\n"
"To znamená, že sa vám už samovoľne nezmení otočenie obrazovky vášho "
"zariadenia.\n"
"Keď nie je začiarknuté, predvolené otočenie prehliadača súborov a predvolená/"
"uložené otočenie čítačky sa navzájom neovplyvnia (t. j. budú rešpektované) a "
"môžu sa aj vzájomne líšiť."

msgid "Image viewer rotation"
msgstr "Otočenie prehliadača obrázkov"

msgid "Invert default rotation in portrait mode"
msgstr "Invertovať predvolené otočenie v režime portrétu"

msgid "Invert default rotation in landscape mode"
